"description": "The Marzetti Co. engages in the manufacture and sale of specialty food products. It operates through the following business segments: Retail and Foodservice. The Retail segment focuses on the manufacture and sale of frozen breads, refrigerated dressings and dips, and shelf-stable dressings and croutons. The Foodservice segment is involved in the manufacture and sale of custom-formulated sauces, salad dressings, frozen breads, and yeast rolls. The company was founded in 1961 and is headquartered in Westerville, OH.",
